          "Keep model initialization separate from the user interaction layer. This makes it possible to cancel an initialization attempt, prevent duplicate downloads, report progress, and release resources when the feature is no longer needed. Avoid loading model weights on every component render. Cache the initialized pipeline at an application-level service boundary and expose a small interface to the UI."
