          "Browser storage is subject to quota policies and eviction. Treat cached model files as recoverable assets, not durable user data. Handle a cleared cache, interrupted download, insufficient storage, and version change gracefully. If you publish model assets through a CDN, pin compatible revisions and provide integrity checks where your distribution pipeline supports them."
