          "Be explicit about what leaves the device. For example, a product may download model weights, send anonymous operational telemetry, and allow users to export generated text. Those are different data flows and should be documented separately. If the product promises offline operation, test it with network access disabled after the required assets have been cached. Do not describe a system as air-gapped merely because inference runs in the browser.",
