          "Separate read operations from mutations. Listing files, reading a specific document, sending an email, deleting a directory, and deploying code have very different consequences. Apply least privilege to each tool and require a human approval step for actions that send external communications, alter production systems, disclose sensitive data, or destroy user content.",
