          "Make invalid states fail closed. Missing signatures, expired credentials, unknown algorithms, malformed encodings, and ambiguous identities should be rejected. Avoid permissive fallback behavior that turns a strict control into a best-effort check. Where compatibility requires multiple versions, make the accepted set explicit and remove obsolete versions on a planned schedule."
