          "Avoid verifying one representation and then acting on another. For signed webhooks, for example, verify the original raw request body before parsing or reserializing it. For URLs and paths, normalize once and enforce policy on the normalized value that will actually be used.",
          "Add test vectors for whitespace, Unicode normalization, mixed-case headers, repeated parameters, invalid byte sequences, and alternate encodings. These cases expose parser disagreements that ordinary happy-path tests rarely detect."
