          "Distinguish the current user from the account that runs a task or service. A process started interactively may inherit a profile, environment variables, mapped drives, and credentials that are unavailable in a non-interactive session. Reproduce the production execution identity and working directory during testing.",
          "Addressing this requires a deep understanding of underlying operating system primitives, network protocols, and cryptographic boundaries rather than relying on brittle third-party abstractions."
