          "Retries should be bounded, jittered, and limited to errors that are likely to recover. Coordinate retry policy across clients, gateways, queues, and workers to avoid multiplying traffic during an outage. Use dead-letter handling for messages that repeatedly fail, and preserve enough context to replay them safely after correction.",
