          "Run failure-injection exercises in an isolated environment and verify recovery time, data consistency, and operator visibility. Document capacity assumptions and scaling triggers. A design is production-ready when its failure behavior is predictable and recoverable, not merely when a benchmark shows a high peak throughput."
