          "Retry deadlock victims or serialization failures only when the whole transaction is safe to repeat. Use bounded retries with jitter and make external side effects occur after commit or through an outbox.",
          "Monitor lock waits and long-running transactions. A forgotten open transaction can prevent cleanup, increase table bloat, or delay schema changes long after the request that opened it has disappeared."
